You let out a powerful roar that sends your foes in radius [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] into utter confusion (power: [26%, 32%, 38%, 44%, 50% (TL1-5)]) for 3 turns.

The sound wave is so strong, your foes also take [121, 156, 183, 205, 224 (TL1-5; STR 100)] physical damage.

The damage improves with your Strength.

Each point in fire drake talents also increases your fire resistance by 1%.
